																</table>
																<table class="heading_block block-2" width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
																	<tr>
																		<td class="pad" style="width:100%;" align="center">
																			<h1 style="margin: 0; color: #044980; direction: ltr; font-family: Arial, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 38px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 1.2; text-align: left; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; mso-line-height-alt: 46px;"><span class="tinyMce-placeholder" style="word-break: break-word;">You are INVITED to the 1st Shiver TRANSformation Ceremony for Blue Shark Friends</span></h1>
																		</td>
																	</tr>
																</table>
																<table class="paragraph_block block-3" width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; word-break: break-word;">
																	<tr>
																		<td class="pad">
																			<div style="color:#044980;direction:ltr;font-family:'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', 'Lucida Sans Unicode', 'Lucida Sans', Tahoma, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:1.2;text-align:left;mso-line-height-alt:19px;">
																				<p style="margin: 0;">Hi <span id="new_member_name">Guest</span>!</p>
																			</div>
																		</td>
																	</tr>
																</table>
																<table class="paragraph_block block-4" width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; word-break: break-word;">
																	<tr>
																		<td class="pad">
																			<div style="color:#044980;direction:ltr;font-family:'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', 'Lucida Sans Unicode', 'Lucida Sans', Tahoma, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:1.2;text-align:left;mso-line-height-alt:19px;">
																				<p style="margin: 0;">I really want to thank you for all of the support that you have provided to Blue Shark Friends.&nbsp; This company would not exist without you.</p>
																			</div>
																		</td>
																	</tr>
																</table>
																<table class="paragraph_block block-5" width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; word-break: break-word;">
																	<tr>
																		<td class="pad">
																			<div style="color:#044980;direction:ltr;font-family:'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', 'Lucida Sans Unicode', 'Lucida Sans', Tahoma, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:1.2;text-align:left;mso-line-height-alt:19px;">
																				<p style="margin: 0;">As I write this email template, I struggle to find a way to appropriately value the contributions of the people who have supported us from beyond our community.&nbsp; I've yet to meet a single person who believes that they are deserving of such praise.&nbsp; Who believes that they are doing enough.</p>
																			</div>
																		</td>
																	</tr>
																</table>
																<table class="paragraph_block block-6" width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; word-break: break-word;">
																	<tr>
																		<td class="pad">
																			<div style="color:#044980;direction:ltr;font-family:'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', 'Lucida Sans Unicode', 'Lucida Sans', Tahoma, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:1.2;text-align:left;mso-line-height-alt:19px;">
																				<p style="margin: 0;">But YOU are enough.</p>
																			</div>
																		</td>
																	</tr>
																</table>
																<table class="paragraph_block block-7" width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; word-break: break-word;">
																	<tr>
																		<td class="pad">
																			<div style="color:#044980;direction:ltr;font-family:'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', 'Lucida Sans Unicode', 'Lucida Sans', Tahoma, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:1.2;text-align:left;mso-line-height-alt:19px;">
																				<p style="margin: 0;">Not because of your labor.&nbsp; Not because of your donations.&nbsp; But simply because you are here.&nbsp; You believe in us.&nbsp; Do you know how many newly founded companies wish their labor/client/partner pool was full of people who wanted to do more for the organization.&nbsp; We are the envy of the capitalistic world.&nbsp; You made that possible.</p>
																			</div>
																		</td>
																	</tr>
																</table>
																<table class="paragraph_block block-8" width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; word-break: break-word;">
																	<tr>
																		<td class="pad">
																			<div style="color:#044980;direction:ltr;font-family:'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', 'Lucida Sans Unicode', 'Lucida Sans', Tahoma, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:1.2;text-align:left;mso-line-height-alt:19px;">
																				<p style="margin: 0;">Thank you.&nbsp; For everything.</p>
																			</div>
																		</td>
																	</tr>
																</table>
																<table class="divider_block block-9" width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
																	<tr>
																		<td class="pad" align="center">
																			<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" width="100%" style="mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
																				<tr>
																					<td class="divider_inner" style="font-size: 1px; line-height: 1px; border-top: 1px solid #dddddd;"><span style="word-break: break-word;">&#8202;</span></td>
																				</tr>
																			</table>
																		</td>
																	</tr>
																</table>
																<table class="paragraph_block block-10" width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; word-break: break-word;">
																	<tr>
																		<td class="pad">
																			<div style="color:#044980;direction:ltr;font-family:'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', 'Lucida Sans Unicode', 'Lucida Sans', Tahoma, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:1.2;text-align:left;mso-line-height-alt:19px;">
																				<p style="margin: 0;">We would like to formally invite you this year to participate as a member of the Blue Shark Friends community.&nbsp; If that interests you, please fill out the form below so we can celebrate you at the Shiver TRANSformation Ceremony.</p>
																			</div>
																		</td>
																	</tr>
																</table>
