<![endif]--><span class="button" style="background-color: #3fa4bc; border-bottom: 0px solid transparent; border-left: 0px solid transparent; border-radius: 4px; border-right: 0px solid transparent; border-top: 0px solid transparent; color: #d9d267; display: inline-block; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', 'Lucida Sans Unicode', 'Lucida Sans', Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; mso-border-alt: none; text-align: center; width: auto; word-break: keep-all; letter-spacing: normal;"><span class="btn-pad" style="word-break: break-word; padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px; padding-top: 5px; padding-bottom: 5px; display: block;"><span style="word-break: break-word; line-height: 32px;">Join Blue Shark Friends</span></span></span><!--[if mso]></center></v:textbox></v:roundrect><![endif]--></a></td>
																	</tr>
																</table>
																<table class="paragraph_block block-12" width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; word-break: break-word;">
																	<tr>
																		<td class="pad">
																			<div style="color:#044980;direction:ltr;font-family:'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', 'Lucida Sans Unicode', 'Lucida Sans', Tahoma, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:1.2;text-align:left;mso-line-height-alt:19px;">
																				<p style="margin: 0;">Our only request of you as a member this year is that you be willing to sign our <a href="https://bluesharkfriends.com/agreement" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: underline; color: #3fa4bc;" rel="noopener">Community Agreement</a> some time between August 14th and August 30th of 2026.&nbsp; The ability to sign on to the agreement will be opened at the end of the Shiver TRANSformation Ceremony on August 14th and will close at 11:59:59 EST August 30th.</p>
																			</div>
																		</td>
																	</tr>
																</table>
																<table class="divider_block block-13" width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
																	<tr>
																		<td class="pad" align="center">
																			<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" width="100%" style="mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
																				<tr>
																					<td class="divider_inner" style="font-size: 1px; line-height: 1px; border-top: 1px solid #dddddd;"><span style="word-break: break-word;">&#8202;</span></td>
																				</tr>
																			</table>
																		</td>
																	</tr>
																</table>
																<table class="paragraph_block block-14" width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; word-break: break-word;">
																	<tr>
																		<td class="pad">
																			<div style="color:#044980;direction:ltr;font-family:'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', 'Lucida Sans Unicode', 'Lucida Sans', Tahoma, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:1.2;text-align:left;mso-line-height-alt:19px;">
																				<p style="margin: 0;">Finally!&nbsp; We will be hosting our 1st Shiver TRANSformation Ceremony.&nbsp; This will be a time to celebrate our members growth and accomplishments inside and outside of Blue Shark Friends.&nbsp; You are INVITED whether or not you choose to formally join the community.&nbsp; Come celebrate with us.&nbsp; This event will be held over Zoom on August 14, 2026 at 7 pm MST.</p>
																			</div>
																		</td>
																	</tr>
																</table>
																<table class="paragraph_block block-15" width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; word-break: break-word;">
																	<tr>
																		<td class="pad">
																			<div style="color:#044980;direction:ltr;font-family:'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', 'Lucida Sans Unicode', 'Lucida Sans', Tahoma, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:1.2;text-align:left;mso-line-height-alt:19px;">
																				<p style="margin: 0;">You can let us know if you will be attending, by selecting the link below:</p>
																			</div>
																		</td>
																	</tr>
																</table>
